{
  "id": "MRK.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mark 16",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Has Risen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the Sabbath was over, Mary Magdalene, Mary the mother of James, and Salome bought spices so that they might go to anoint Jesus' body.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Very early on the first day of the week, just after sunrise, they were on their way to the tomb",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and they asked each other, \"Who will roll the stone away from the entrance of the tomb?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when they looked up, they saw that the stone, which was very large, had been rolled away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As they entered the tomb, they saw a young man dressed in a white robe sitting on the right side, and they were alarmed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Don't be alarmed,\" he said. \"You are looking for Jesus the Nazarene, who was crucified. He has risen! He is not here. See the place where they laid him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But go, tell his disciples and Peter, 'He is going ahead of you into Galilee. There you will see him, just as he told you.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Trembling and bewildered, the women went out and fled from the tomb. They said nothing to anyone, because they were afraid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "iex"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "[The earliest manuscripts and some other ancient witnesses do not have",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "xt",
            "link-href": "MRK 16:9-20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "id": "MRK.16.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "verses 9–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".]",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "When Jesus rose early on the first day of the week, he appeared first to Mary Magdalene, out of whom he had driven seven demons.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.16.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.16.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "She went and told those who had been with him and who were mourning and weeping.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.16.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.16.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "When they heard that Jesus was alive and that she had seen him, they did not believe it.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.16.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.16.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Afterward Jesus appeared in a different form to two of them while they were walking in the country.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.16.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.16.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "These returned and reported it to the rest; but they did not believe them either.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.16.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.16.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Later Jesus appeared to the Eleven as they were eating; he rebuked them for their lack of faith and their stubborn refusal to believe those who had seen him after he had risen.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.16.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.16.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "He said to them,",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.16.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.16.15"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "char",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "style": "wj"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "\"Go into all the world and preach the gospel to all creation.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "attrs": {
                    "verseId": "MRK.16.15",
                    "verseOrgIds": [
                      "MRK.16.15"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "char",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "style": "wj"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Whoever believes and is baptized will be saved, but whoever does not believe will be condemned.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "attrs": {
                    "verseId": "MRK.16.16",
                    "verseOrgIds": [
                      "MRK.16.16"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "char",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "style": "wj"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "And these signs will accompany those who believe: In my name they will drive out demons; they will speak in new tongues;",
                  "type": "text",
                  "attrs": {
                    "verseId": "MRK.16.17",
                    "verseOrgIds": [
                      "MRK.16.17"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "char",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "style": "wj"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "they will pick up snakes with their hands; and when they drink deadly poison, it will not hurt them at all; they will place their hands on sick people, and they will get well.\"",
                  "type": "text",
                  "attrs": {
                    "verseId": "MRK.16.18",
                    "verseOrgIds": [
                      "MRK.16.18"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "After the Lord Jesus had spoken to them, he was taken up into heaven and he sat at the right hand of God.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.16.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.16.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "it"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Then the disciples went out and preached everywhere, and the Lord worked with them and confirmed his word by the signs that accompanied it.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.16.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.16.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
